{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"5":"The Book of Salah"},"section_detail":{"5":{"hadithnumber_first":448,"hadithnumber_last":493,"arabicnumber_first":448,"arabicnumber_last":493,"name_native":"The Book of Salah"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":477,"arabicnumber":477,"text":"It was narrated from Anas bin Malik that the Prophet (ﷺ) prayed Zuhr in Al-Madinah, four Rak'ahs, and he prayed 'Asr in Dhul-Hulaifah, two Rak'ahs","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":5,"hadith":30}}]}